#: about.php include/global_arrays.php lib/html.php
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Game da Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "An tsara Cacti don ya zama cikakkiyar hanyar zana jadawalai bisa ga RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) da tsarin zana jadawalai. Manufarsa ita ce sauƙaƙa aikin Mai Gudanar da Cibiyar Sadarwa ta hanyar kula da dukkan muhimman bayanai da ake buƙata don ƙirƙirar Jadawalai masu ma'ana."

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Da fatan za a duba %1$sshafin yanar gizon Cacti%2$s na hukuma don samun bayanai kan yadda ake amfani da Cacti, samun tallafi, da sabuntawa."

#: about.php
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Masu Haɓakawa Masu Aiki"

#: about.php
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Masu haɓakawa da ke aiki a kan Cacti, Tsarin Gininsa, Takardun Bayani da Fitarwa na Gaba."

#: about.php
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Yabo na Musamman"

#: about.php
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Masu ba da gudummawa ga Takardun Bayani, Tabbatar da Inganci (QA), Shirya Fakiti, Dandalin Tattaunawa da shafinmu na YouTube."

#: about.php
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Tsofaffin Mambobi Masu Daraja"

#: about.php
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Mambobin ƙungiyar Cacti ta asali waɗanda suka ci gaba a cikin ayyukansu. Muna ci gaba da yi musu fatan alheri."

#: about.php
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Godiya"

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Godiya ta musamman ga %1$sTobi Oetiker%2$s, wanda ya ƙirƙiri %3$sRRDtool%4$s da kuma shahararren %5$sMRTG%6$s."

#: about.php
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Masu amfani da Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Musamman duk wanda ya ɗauki lokaci don ƙirƙirar rahoton matsala, ko kuma ya taimaka wajen gyara matsalolin da suka shafi Cacti. Haka kuma ga duk wanda ya ba da gudummawa wajen tallafawa Cacti."

#: about.php
msgid "License"
msgstr "Lasisi"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "An ba wa Cacti lasisi ƙarƙashin GNU GPL:"

#: about.php lib/installer.php
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Wannan shirin manhaja ce kyauta; za ka iya sake rarraba shi da/ko gyara shi ƙarƙashin sharuɗɗan GNU General Public License kamar yadda Free Software Foundation ta wallafa; ko dai sigar 2 ta Lasisin, ko (bisa zaɓinka) kowace siga ta gaba."

#: about.php
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Ana rarraba wannan shirin ne da fatan zai yi amfani, amma BA TARE DA WANI GARANTI BA; har ma ba tare da garantin da ake nufi na KASUWANCI ko DACEWA DA WATA MANUFA TA MUSAMMAN ba. Duba GNU General Public License don ƙarin bayani."

