msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, duk wani yunƙuri na shiga Cacti za a karkatar da shi zuwa HTTPS domin tabbatar da babban tsaro."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Ba da Izinin Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa mai Haɗari na HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Ba da izinin amfani da Takaddun Shaida da aka Sa Hannu da Kai kuma a ba da izinin sunan uwar garken Takardar Shaidar ya bambanta da na Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Ba da Izinin Alamomi Masu Haɗari (Metacharacters) a cikin Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "A tarihi, masu gudanar da Cacti sun ƙirƙiri Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai masu sauƙi waɗanda suka haɗa da umarni kamar \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" don wakiltar ƙimar lamba don amfani a cikin Zane-zanen Cacti.  A tsofaffin nau'ikan Cacti, an ba da izinin wannan.  Duk da haka, wannan aiki ne mai haɗari domin hanya ce ga masu amfani na ɓangare na uku don wallafa Samfuran Bayanai marasa tsaro.  A cikin Cacti na zamani, ya kamata a guji irin waɗannan ayyuka.  Duk da haka, mun samar da wannan zaɓin idan kana da tsofaffin Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai waɗanda ke ɗauke da waɗannan Alamomi Masu Haɗari (Meta Characters) kuma ba ka mayar da su zuwa rubutun shiri na gida a cikin kundin 'scripts' ba.  Lokacin da ba a zaɓi wannan zaɓin ba, Cacti yana taƙaita alamomin shell kamar alamomin faɗa (quotation marks), baƙaƙen lanƙwasa (curly brackets), sandunan tsaye (vertical bars), layin baya (backslashes), da alamomin baya (backticks).  Cacti yana ci gaba da ba da izinin alamomin ya-fi da ya-gaza don abubuwa kamar <path_cacti> da kuma sigogin shigarwa, amma idan ba a zaɓi wannan zaɓin ba, iyakar izinin amfaninsu ke nan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Manufar Rubutun Tsaron Abun Ciki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Yana sarrafa manufar CSP ta script-src.  A cikin Yanayin Nonce, Karin Ayyukan Cacti (Plugins) da ke amfani da JavaScript na cikin layi dole ne su haɗa da siffar nonce daga aikin Cacti na ciki 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. In ba haka ba, mai binciken yanar gizo zai toshe waɗannan rubutun shirin.  A halin yanzu, Cacti yana ba da izinin bayar da rahoto kawai game da Karin Ayyukan Cacti waɗanda ba sa amfani da Yanayin Nonce yadda ya kamata.  A nan gaba, za mu ba wa Masu Gudanarwa damar toshe irin waɗannan ƙarin ayyukan daga amfani da JavaScript na cikin layi idan ba sa amfani da Nonces."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Ba da Izinin JavaScript na Cikin Layi Mara Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Ba da Izinin duka unsafe-eval da JavaScript na Cikin Layi Mara Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Yanayin Nonce - Rahoto Kawai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI na Rahoton Take Dokar CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL inda masu binciken yanar gizo ke aika (POST) rahotannin take dokar CSP a cikin yanayin nonce-report da nonce. A bar shi fanko don amfani da <url_path>/csp_report.php. Dole ne ya ƙunshi haruffan URL masu aminci kawai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Madadin Tushen Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Sunayen yankunan yanar gizo da aka raba da sarari waɗanda za a ba da izinin shiga wajen Sabar Yanar Gizo kanta.  Wannan yana da muhimmanci ga masu amfani da suka zaɓi yin amfani da CDN, ko shafin ɗaukar bayanai.  Tushe na iya haɗawa da alamun duniya (wildcards) misali: *.mydomain.com, ko ƙa'idar sadarwa, misali: https://*.example.com.  Waɗannan Madadin Tushe sun haɗa da nau'ikan Hoto, CSS da JavaScript kaɗai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL inda masu binciken yanar gizo ke aika rahotannin keta CSP ta hanyar POST a yanayin nonce-report da nonce. A bar shi fanko don amfani da /cacti/csp_report.php a tushen shigarwa. Dole ne ya ƙunshi haruffan URL masu aminci kaɗai."

