#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "An Kunna Tattara Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Idan kana son dakatar da aikin tattara bayanai gaba ɗaya, cire alamar wannan akwatin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Nau'in Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Nau'in poller da za a yi amfani da shi.  Wannan saitin zai fara aiki a tazarar tattara bayanai ta gaba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Daidaita Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Tazarar daidaita tattara bayanai ta asali da za a yi amfani da ita lokacin ƙirƙirar poller.  Wannan saitin zai shafi yawan lokutan da ake duba da sabunta pollers na nesa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Tazarar tattara bayanai da ake amfani da ita.  Wannan saitin zai shafi yawan lokutan da ake duba da sabunta RRDfiles.  <strong><u>LURA: Idan ka canza wannan ƙima, dole ne ka sake cika cache na poller.  Rashin yin hakan na iya haifar da asarar bayanai.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Yawan lokacin da za a riƙa fara mai tattara bayanai na Cacti.  Za ka iya amfani da ko dai crontab, aikin da aka tsara (don Windows), ko sabis ɗin systemd na cactid don sarrafa ƙaddamar da mai tattara bayanai na Cacti.  Don umarni kan amfani da cactid daemon, duba fayil ɗin README.md a cikin foldar service."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Daidaita Nauyin Tsari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Idan ka zaɓi wannan zaɓin, Cacti zai yi ƙoƙarin daidaita nauyin kowane tsarin poller ta hanyar rarraba abubuwan poller daidai wa daida a kowane tsari."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Faɗin Fitowar Binciken Kuskure"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Idan ka zaɓi wannan zaɓin, Cacti zai duba fitarwar da ta wuce ƙarfin Cacti na adana ta kuma ya ba da gargaɗi idan ya same ta."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Ƙarewar Lokacin Wakili na Nesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Yawan lokacin, a cikin daƙiƙoƙi, da babbar sabar yanar gizo ta Cacti za ta jira amsa daga Mai Tara Bayanai na Nesa don samun bayanan Na'urori daban-daban kafin ta watsar da buƙatar. A kan Na'urorin da ke da alaƙa da Masu Tara Bayanai ban da Babban Mai Tara Bayanai na Cacti, dole ne a yi amfani da Wakilin Nesa don tattara bayanan Na'ura."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Sabunta Teburin Poller a Kowane Zagaye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Wannan saitin na tsarin poller guda ɗaya ne kawai don sake gina teburin fitarwar poller a kowane zagayen tattara bayanai don hana teburin ƙwaƙwalwa yin swap a kan manyan tsare-tsare masu manyan rumbunan bayanai waɗanda za su iya amfani da swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Kashe Rarraba Kwafin Cache na Albarkatu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Ta tsohuwa, babban Mai Tattara Bayanai na Cacti zai adana duka gidan yanar gizon da ƙarin manhajoji a cikin Rumbun Ajiyar Albarkatu. Sannan, lokaci zuwa lokaci Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa za su sabunta kansu da duk wani sabuntawa daga babban Mai Tattara Bayanai na Cacti. Wannan Rumbun Ajiyar Albarkatu yana ba wa Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa damar sabunta kansu da kansu. Idan ba ka son amfani da wannan zaɓin, za ka iya kashe shi ta amfani da wannan saitin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Halin Aikin SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "An Kunna Tallafin Wakilin SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓi wannan zaɓin, Cacti zai cika teburan Wakilin SNMP da bayanan na'ura da na tsarin Cacti. Ba ya kunna Wakilin SNMP ɗin da kansa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Kunna MD5 da DES don SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Ƙa'idojin tabbatarwa na MD5 da na sirri na DES tsofaffi ne, masu rauni, kuma ba sa samuwa a kan ginannun PHP da Net-SNMP masu ƙarfi (FIPS). Lokacin da aka kashe su, ana cire MD5 da DES daga jerin zaɓuɓɓukan Ka'idar Tabbatarwa da Sirri ta SNMPv3 da ake nunawa yayin gyara Na'ura da kuma a cikin Zaɓuɓɓukan SNMP na Automation, ana barin ƙa'idojin SHA da AES masu ƙarfi kawai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Kunna Ma'ajin Wucin Gadi na Shaidar Shiga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Tsananta da adana sigogin shaidar shiga na SNMPv3 sau ɗaya a kowane sauyin shaidar shiga domin kowane tsarin mai tattara bayanai ya sake amfani da su maimakon sake gina su a kowace buƙata. Wannan yana ba da ɗan tanadi lokacin tattarawa da shaidun shiga na SNMPv3 ta hanyar fayilolin aiwatarwa na Net-SNMP. Ƙarin php-snmp yana sarrafa mafi yawan karɓar SNMPv3 a cikin tsari kuma yana ƙetare wannan ma'ajin wucin gadi, amma har yanzu ana amfani da fayilolin Net-SNMP (saboda haka wannan ma'ajin wucin gadi) don zagayen SNMP, fitarwar hex, buƙatun da ke saita context ko engine id, da haɗe-haɗen ƙa'idoji waɗanda sigar PHP da ke aiki ba ta goyan baya ba. Kunna wannan idan kana tattara kowane ɗayan waɗannan ayyukan da shaidun shiga na SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Iyakar SNMP Get OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Tsohon matsakaicin adadin SNMP Get OIDs da za a bayar a kowace buƙatar snmpget. Ga Na'urori, ana sarrafa wannan saitin a matakin Na'ura. Ya kamata ka yi amfani da wannan saitin ne kawai lokacin da kake amfani da SNMP API na Cacti kai tsaye a cikin rubuce-rubucen umarninka ko ƙarin shirye-shirye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Girman Ɗauko Bayanai na SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "OID nawa ya kamata a dawo da su a kowace buƙatar snmpbulkwalk?  Ga Na'urori masu manyan bishiyoyin SNMP, ƙara wannan girman zai ƙara saurin sake yin fihirisa ta kan WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Kashe duba ƙaruwar OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Yana sarrafa kashe duba ƙaruwar OID yayin bin bishiyar OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Ƙarin Saitunan Mai Tattara Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Adana Rahoton Bayanan da Ba Su Dace Ba"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Ta yaya kake son a adana rahoton kurakuran fitarwa na Mai Tattara Bayanai? Zaɓuɓɓuka sun haɗa da: 'Cikakke' wanda ke ba da cikakken bayani kan kowane kuskure, 'Taƙaitacce' wanda ke ba da adadin kurakuran fitarwa ga kowace Na'ura, da 'Babu', wanda ba ya ba da ƙidayar kurakurai."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Taƙaitacce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Cikakke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Adadin Sabar Rubutun PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Adadin ayyukan sabar rubutu masu gudana a lokaci guda ga kowane aikin spine. Ana karɓar saituna tsakanin 1 zuwa 15. Wannan siga zai taimaka idan kana gudanar da zaren ayyuka da yawa da rubuce-rubucen sabar rubutu kuma yana aiki ne kawai ga Mai Tattara Bayanai na spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Ƙimar Lokacin Ƙarewa na Rubutu da Sabar Rubutu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Mafi tsawon lokacin da spine zai jira don rubutun umarni ya kammala.  Wannan ƙimar ƙarewar lokaci tana cikin daƙiƙoƙi kuma tana aiki ne kawai ga Mai Tara Bayanai na spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Sake Jerin Duka Na'urori na Lokaci-lokaci"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Jadawalin Sake Jerin Duka Na'urori"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "A wane lokaci ne kake son Sake Jerin duka Na'urori. Wannan Sake Jerin zai faru da tsakar dare a mita da ka zaɓa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Mako-mako a Ranar Lahadi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunady"
msgstr "Kowane wata a ranar Lahadi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Ƙarewar Lokaci na Baya da Ayyuka Masu Gudana a Lokaci Ɗaya"

#: include/global_settings.php
