#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Tsoffin Saitunan Mai Tara Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Ana kula da waɗannan saitunan a matakin Mai Tara Bayanai.  Ƙimomin da ke nan tsoffin saituna ne kawai da ake amfani da su lokacin fara ƙirƙirar Mai Tara Bayanai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Ayyukan Mai Tara Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Cacti 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Tsohon adadin ayyuka masu gudana a lokaci ɗaya da za a aiwatar ga kowane Mai Tara Bayanai.  LURA: Farawa daga Cacti 1.2, ana kula da wannan saitin a cikin Mai Tara Bayanai.  Nan gaba, wannan ƙimar saiti ce kawai ta farko don Mai Tara Bayanai.  Yin amfani da lamba mafi girma yayin amfani da cmd.php zai inganta aiki.  Inganta aiki a cikin Spine ya fi kyau a magance shi da sigar threads.  Yayin amfani da Spine, muna ba da shawarar lamba ƙarama da amfani da threads a maimakon haka.  Yayin amfani da cmd.php, kada a yi amfani da fiye da ninki 2x na adadin cibiyoyin CPU."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Threads ga Kowane Aiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Cacti 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Tsoffin Threads da aka yarda da su ga kowane aiki.  LURA: Farawa a Cacti 1.2+, ana kula da wannan saitin a cikin Mai Tara Bayanai, kuma wannan saiti ne na farko kawai.  Yin amfani da lamba mafi girma yayin amfani da Spine zai inganta aiki.  Duk da haka, a tabbatar kana da isassun haɗin MySQL/MariaDB don tallafa wa wannan lissafin: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  Dole ne kuma ka tabbatar kana da isassun ƙarin haɗi don haɗin shigar masu amfani."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Tantancewa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Tantancewa ta Ciki</i> - Cacti ke kula da tantance masu amfani, wanda ke ba ka damar ƙirƙirar masu amfani da ba su haƙƙoƙi a sassa daban-daban a cikin Cacti.<br><br><i>Tantancewar Asali ta Yanar Gizo</i> - Sabar yanar gizo ce ke kula da tantancewa. Ana iya ƙara ko ƙirƙirar masu amfani ta atomatik a shiga na farko idan an ayyana Mai Amfani na Samfuri, in ba haka ba za a yi amfani da izinin baƙo da aka ayyana.<br><br><i>Tantancewar LDAP</i> - Yana ba da damar tantancewa akan sabar LDAP. Za a ƙirƙiri masu amfani ta atomatik a shiga na farko idan an ayyana Mai Amfani na Samfuri, in ba haka ba za a yi amfani da izinin baƙo da aka ayyana. Idan ba a kunna tsarin LDAP na PHP ba, Tantancewar LDAP ba za ta bayyana a matsayin zaɓin da za a iya zaɓa ba.<br><br><i>Tantancewar Yankuna Masu Yawa na LDAP/AD</i> - Yana ba masu gudanarwa damar tallafa wa ƙungiyoyi daban-daban masu yawa daga kundin adireshi na LDAP/AD daban-daban don samun damar albarkatun Cacti. Kamar Tantancewar LDAP, ana buƙatar tsarin PHP LDAP don amfani da wannan hanyar.</blockquote>"

