#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Sabunta RRD Bisa Buƙata"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Kunna Sabunta RRD Bisa Buƙata"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Shin Boost ya kunna sabunta RRD bisa buƙata a cikin Cacti? Idan ka kashe, wannan canjin ba zai fara aiki ba sai bayan zagayen tattara bayanai na gaba. Idan kana da Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa, ana buƙatar wannan saitin ya kasance a kunne."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Mai Sabunta RRD na Matakin Tsari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Kafin a iya share Sabunta RRD Bisa Buƙata, dole ne gudanarwar poller ta wuce koyaushe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Sau Nawa Ya Kamata Boost Ya Sabunta Dukkan RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Lokacin da ka kunna Boost, ana sabunta fayilolin RRD naka ne kawai idan mai amfani ya buƙace su, ko kuma lokacin da wannan wa'adin lokaci ya cika."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Adadin Ayyukan Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Adadin ayyukan Boost masu gudana a lokaci guda da za a yi amfani da su don sarrafa dukkan RRD a cikin teburin Boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Iyakar Adadin Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Idan teburin fitarwa na Boost ya wuce wannan adadi, a cikin bayanai, za a yi sabuntawa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Target Archive Rows Per Range"
msgstr "Adadin Layukan Taskacewa da Ake Hari a Kowane Zango"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Boost updater assigns complete Local Data IDs to contiguous ranges near this row count. A single Local Data ID is never split, so a range can exceed the target. Lower this value to reduce updater memory and query time. The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Mai sabuntawa na Boost yana sanya cikakkun Local Data IDs zuwa zangon da ke jere kusa da wannan adadin layukan. Ba a taɓa raba Local Data ID guda ɗaya, don haka zango na iya wuce abin da aka sa a gaba. Rage wannan ƙima don rage ƙwaƙwalwar mai sabuntawa da lokacin tambaya (query). Ƙimar asali ita ce 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Iyakar Tsawon Hujja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Lokacin da Boost ke aika umarnin sabuntawa zuwa RRDtool, bai kamata ya wuce Iyakar Tsawon Hujja ta tsarin aiki ba. Wannan yana bambanta dangane da tsarin aiki da matakin kernel. Misali: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ babu iyaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Iyakar Ƙwaƙwalwar Ajiya don Boost da Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Mafi yawan adadin ƙwaƙwalwar ajiya don Poller na Cacti da Poller na Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Iyakar Lokacin Gudanar da Rubutun Sabunta RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "Idan poller na Boost ya wuce wannan lokacin gudanarwa, za a sanya gargaɗi a cikin rajistar Cacti,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRDs Queued"
msgstr "Mafi Yawan RRD da Suka Gaza a Layin Jira"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of RRD destinations retained for automatic Boost retry. Only the latest complete failed update is retained per destination."
msgstr "Mafi yawan adadin wuraren RRD da ake riƙewa don sake gwadawar Boost ta atomatik. Sabuntawar ƙarshe da ta gaza cikakke ce kaɗai ake riƙewa ga kowane wuri."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Failed RRD Retry Budget"
msgstr "Iyakar Sake Gwadawar RRD da Ta Gaza"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum queued RRD destinations retried by one scheduled Boost run."
msgstr "Mafi yawan wuraren RRD da ke kan layin jira da za a sake gwadawa a cikin aikin Boost guda ɗaya da aka tsara."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRD Retries"
msgstr "Mafi Yawan Sake Gwadawar RRD da Ta Gaza"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Queued RRD updates are explicitly discarded after this many failed automatic attempts."
msgstr "Ana watsar da sabuntawar RRD da ke kan layin jira kai tsaye bayan wannan yawan yunƙurin atomatik da suka gaza."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRD Age"
msgstr "Mafi Tsawon Lokacin RRD da Ta Gaza"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Days to retain the latest failed RRD update before explicit discard."
msgstr "Kwanakin riƙe sabuntawar RRD ta ƙarshe da ta gaza kafin a watsar da ita kai tsaye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Debug Log"
msgstr "Rajistar Gyaran Kuskure ta Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this field is non-blank, Boost will log RRDUpdate output from the boost\tpoller process."
msgstr "Idan wannan filin ba fanko ba ne, Boost zai adana sakamakon RRDUpdate daga tsarin boost\tpoller."

