#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Cirewa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Akwai hanyoyin cirewa guda biyu. Ta farko, Standard Deviation, za ta cire duk wani samfurin da ya yi nisa da adadin standard deviations X daga matsakaicin samfuran. Hanya ta biyu, Variance, za ta cire duk wani samfurin da ya fi matsakaicin Variance da kashi X%. Hanyar Variance tana yin la'akari da wani adadi na 'waɗanda suka fita zakka' (outliers). Waɗannan samfura ne na musamman, kamar hauhawa kwatsam (spike), waɗanda ke buƙatar a cire su daga lissafin Matsakaicin Variance."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Madaidaicin Karkacewa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Dogara da Variance Tare da Cire Waɗanda Suka Fita Zakka"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Maye Gurbi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Akwai hanyoyin maye gurbi guda uku. Hanyar farko tana maye gurbin ƙaruwar ba-zata da matsakaicin tushen bayanan da abin ya shafa. Hanya ta biyu tana maye gurbin ƙaruwar ba-zata da 'NaN'. Ta ƙarshe tana maye gurbin ƙaruwar ba-zata da ƙima mai kyau ta ƙarshe da aka samu."

