msgstr "Kashi na Variance"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Wannan ƙima tana wakiltar kashi na sama da daidaitaccen matsakaicin samfurin da zarar an cire waɗanda suka fita zakka daga samfurin. Misali, Kashi na Variance na 100%% a kan daidaitaccen matsakaici na 50 zai cire duk wani samfurin da ya fi yawan 100 daga zane."

