msgstr "Adadin Keɓaɓɓun Bambanci"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Wannan ƙima tana wakiltar adadin samfuran matsakaici masu sama da ƙasa da za a cire daga rukunin samfuran kafin a lissafa Matsakaicin Bambanci. Idan ka zaɓi ƙimar keɓaɓɓu ta 5, to za a cire matsakaitan 5 na sama da 5 na ƙasa duka."

