#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>LURA:</strong> Ka shiga cikin Mai Tara Bayanai na Nesa. Lokacin da yake <b>'a kan layi'</b>, za ka iya kallo da sarrafa mafi yawan Babban Shafin Yanar Gizon Cacti kamar kana cikinsa. Haka kuma, yana da muhimmanci a lura cewa Masu Tara Bayanai na Nesa suna buƙatar amfani da fasalin <b>'Sabuntawa Bisa Buƙata'</b> na Ayyukan Ƙarfafa Aikin Cacti, kuma kullum muna ba da shawarar amfani da Spine. Lokacin da Mai Tara Bayanai na Nesa yake <b>'ba ya kan layi'</b>, Shafin Yanar Gizon Mai Tara Bayanai na Nesa zai ƙunshi ƙananan bayanai. Duk da haka, zai adana duk sabuntawa har sai an iya samun Babban Rumbun Bayanai da Sabar Yanar Gizo ta Cacti. Sannan zai mayar da sakamakon teburin Boost nasa zuwa Babban Rumbun Bayanai na Cacti don sabuntawa."

#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>LURA:</strong> Babu wani daga cikin Muhimman Kayan Aikin Cacti, har zuwa yau, da aka sake tsarawa don yin aiki tare da Masu Tara Bayanai na Nesa. Saboda haka, Kayan Aiki irin su MacTrack, da HMIB, waɗanda ke buƙatar shiga na'urori kai tsaye ba za su yi aiki tare da Masu Tara Bayanai na Nesa a wannan lokacin ba. Duk da haka, kayan aiki irin su Thold za su yi aiki matuƙar Mai Tara Bayanai na Nesa yana cikin yanayin <b>'a kan layi'</b>."

