msgstr "Ƙimar da aka ƙayyade ta yi kama da ta bambanta a cikin saitin da ke aiki idan aka kwatanta da fayil ɗin INI."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "PHP - Module Support (Required)"
msgstr "PHP - Tallafin Modiyul (Ana Buƙata)"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti requires several PHP Modules to be installed to work properly. If any of these are not installed, you will be unable to continue the installation until corrected. In addition, for optimal system performance Cacti should be run with certain MySQL system variables set.  Please follow the MySQL recommendations at your discretion.  Always seek the MySQL documentation if you have any questions."
msgstr "Cacti yana buƙatar a sanya modiyul ɗin PHP da dama don ya yi aiki yadda ya kamata. Idan ba a sanya wani daga cikinsu ba, ba za ku iya ci gaba da sanyawar ba har sai an gyara. Bugu da ƙari, don ingantaccen aikin tsari ya kamata a gudanar da Cacti tare da saita waɗansu masu canjin tsarin MySQL. Da fatan za a bi shawarwarin MySQL bisa ra'ayinku. A koyaushe ku nemi takardun bayanan MySQL idan kuna da wata tambaya."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following PHP extensions are mandatory, and MUST be installed before continuing your Cacti install."
msgstr "Waɗannan ƙarin PHP na gaba tilas ne, kuma DOLE ne a sanya su kafin ci gaba da sanya Cacti ɗinku."

