msgstr "PHP - Tallafin Modiyul (Na Zaɓi)"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following PHP extensions are recommended, and should be installed before continuing your Cacti install.  NOTE: If you are planning on supporting SNMPv3 with IPv6, you should not install the php-snmp module at this time."
msgstr "Ana ba da shawarar waɗannan ƙarin shirye-shiryen PHP, kuma ya kamata a shigar da su kafin ci gaba da shigar da Cacti naka. LURA: Idan kana shirin tallafawa SNMPv3 tare da IPv6, kada ka shigar da sashen php-snmp a wannan lokacin."

