msgstr "MySQL - Tallafin Yankin Lokaci"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your MySQL TimeZone database is not populated.  Please populate this database before proceeding."
msgstr "Ba a cika rumbun bayananku na Yankin Lokaci na MySQL ba. Da fatan za a cika wannan rumbun bayanan kafin ci gaba."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Cacti database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "Asusun shiga rumbun bayanan Cacti ɗinku ba shi da damar shiga rumbun bayanan Yankin Lokaci na MySQL. Da fatan za a ba asusun rumbun bayanan Cacti damar \"select\" zuwa teburin \"time_zone_name\" a cikin rumbun bayanan \"mysql\", kuma a cika bayanan Yankin Lokaci na MySQL kafin ci gaba."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "Asusun rumbun bayanan Cacti ɗinku yana da damar shiga rumbun bayanan Yankin Lokaci na MySQL kuma an cika wannan rumbun bayanan da bayanan Yankin Lokaci na duniya."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "MySQL - Settings"
msgstr "MySQL - Saituna"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Cacti system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Waɗannan saitunan inganta aikin MySQL za su taimaka wa tsarin Cacti ɗinku ya yi aiki mafi kyau ba tare da matsala ba na tsawon lokaci."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Recommended MySQL System Variable Settings"
msgstr "Shawarwarin Saitunan Masu Canjin Tsarin MySQL"

#: lib/installer.php
