msgstr "Nau'in Sanyawa"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Haɓakawa daga <strong>%1$s</strong> zuwa <strong>%2$s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Idan aka sami matsaloli, ana ba da shawara sosai da ku share rumbun ajiyar burauzarku (cache), ku rufe sannan ku sake buɗe burauzarku (ba kawai shafin da Cacti ke kai ba) sannan ku sake gwadawa, kafin ku tura ƙorafi ga The Cacti Group"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "A lokuta da ba kasafai ba, mun sami rahotanni daga masu amfani da suka fuskanci ƙananan matsaloli saboda sauye-sauye a cikin lambar (code). Waɗannan matsalolin sun samo asali ne daga burauzar da ke riƙe da tsohuwar lambar kafin haɓakawa, kuma duk da cewa mun ɗauki matakai don rage yiwuwar hakan, har yanzu yana iya faruwa. Idan kuna buƙatar umarni kan yadda ake share rumbun ajiyar burauzarku, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> wuri ne mai kyau don farawa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Idan bayan kun share rumbun ajiyar burauza kuma kun sake kunna burauzarku, har yanzu kuna fuskantar matsaloli, da fatan za a tura mana ƙorafin kuma za mu yi ƙoƙarin gano musabbabinsa."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Downgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Komawa baya daga <strong>%1$s</strong> zuwa <strong>%2$s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Da alama kuna komawa zuwa sigar da ta gabata. Ba za a mayar da sauye-sauyen rumbun bayanai da aka yi don sabuwar sigar baya ba kuma hakan <i>yana iya</i> haifar da matsaloli."

#: lib/installer.php
