msgstr "Ana amfani da Poller na Nesa don samun damar shiga hanyoyin sadarwar da ba sa samuwa cikin sauƙi ga Babban wuri."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following information has been determined from Cacti's configuration file. If it is not correct, please edit \"include/config.php\" before continuing."
msgstr "An gano waɗannan bayanai masu zuwa daga fayil ɗin saitin Cacti. Idan ba daidai ba ne, da fatan za a gyara \"include/config.php\" kafin ci gaba."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Local Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Bayanin Haɗin Rumbun Bayanai na Gida"

