msgstr "Nau'in Tsarin Aikin Sabar: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Central Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Bayanin Haɗin Rumbun Bayanai na Tsakiya"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration Readonly!"
msgstr "Saitin Na Karatu Kaɗai Ne!"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Dole ne sabar yanar gizo ta iya rubutu a cikin fayil ɗinku na config.php yayin sanyawa don saita Poller na Nesa. Da zarar an kammala sanyawa, dole ne ku saita wannan fayil zuwa Karatu Kaɗai (Read Only) don hana matsalolin tsaro da ka iya tasowa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Saitin Poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Cacti Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Cacti database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Ba a haɗa bayanan Cacti Poller na Nesa ɗinku a cikin fayil ɗinku na config.php ba. Da fatan za a duba config.php.dist, sannan a saita masu canji: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, da sauransu. Dole ne a saita waɗannan masu canjin kuma su nuna zuwa babbar sabar rumbun bayanan Cacti ɗinku. Ku gyara wannan sannan ku sake gwadawa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Masu Canjin Poller na Nesa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The variables that must be set in the config.php file include the following:"
msgstr "Masu canjin da dole ne a saita a cikin fayil ɗin config.php sun haɗa da waɗannan masu zuwa:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Mai sanyawar yana sanya $poller_id ta atomatik kuma yana ƙara shi zuwa fayil ɗin config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Da zarar an saita duk masu canjin a cikin fayil ɗin config.php, dole ne kuma ka ba $rdatabase_username damar shiga babbar uwar garken rumbun adana bayanai ta Cacti.  Bi irin tsarin da za ka bi kamar a kowane shigarwar Cacti.  Daga nan za ka iya danna maɓallin 'Gwada Haɗi'.  Idan gwajin ya yi nasara, za ka iya ci gaba ka kammala shigarwar."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Ƙarin Matakai Bayan Shigarwa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Cacti server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Cacti database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Yana da matuƙar muhimmanci babbar uwar garken Cacti ta tsakiya ta iya sadarwa ta hanyar MySQL zuwa kowace uwar garken rumbun adana bayanai ta Cacti ta nesa.  Da zarar an kammala shigarwar, dole ne ka gyara Mai Tara Bayanai na Nesa kuma ka tabbatar da cewa saitunan suna daidai.  Za ka iya tabbatarwa ta amfani da 'Gwada Haɗi' lokacin da kake gyara Mai Tara Bayanai na Nesa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
msgstr "Wuraren Muhimman Fayilolin Binary da Sigogi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Make sure all of these values are correct before continuing."
msgstr "Ka tabbatar duk waɗannan ƙimomin suna daidai kafin ka ci gaba."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "One or more paths appear to be incorrect, unable to proceed"
msgstr "Hanya ɗaya ko fiye suna kama da ba daidai ba ne, ba za a iya ci gaba ba"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Binciken Izinin Foldoci"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Da fatan za a tabbatar izinin foldocin da ke ƙasa suna daidai kafin a ci gaba.  A lokacin shigarwar, waɗannan foldocin suna buƙatar su kasance mallakar mai amfani na Uwar Garken Yanar Gizo.  Ana buƙatar waɗannan sauye-sauyen izini don bai wa Mai Shigarwa damar shigar da fakitin Samfurin Na'ura waɗanda suka haɗa da fayilolin XML da na rubutun umarni da za a saka a cikin waɗannan foldocin.  Idan ka zaɓi kada ka shigar da fakitin, akwai rubutun umarni na cli 'install_package.php' wanda za a iya amfani da shi daga layin umarni bayan an kammala shigarwar."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Bayan an kammala shigarwar, za ka iya mayar da wasu daga cikin waɗannan foldocin su zama na karantawa kaɗai don ƙara tsaro."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Cacti remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Cacti Web Site changes"
msgstr "Za a buƙaci waɗannan foldocin su ci gaba da kasancewa masu izinin karantawa da rubutawa bayan shigarwar domin tsarin daidaitawa na nesa na Cacti ya iya sabunta su yayin da Babban Shafin Yanar Gizon Cacti ya canza"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Idan kana shigar da fakiti, da zarar an shigar da fakitin, ya kamata ka mayar da foldar scripts ta koma ta karantawa kaɗai domin hakan na iya fallasa shafin yanar gizon ga haɗari."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Ga masu tattara bayanai na nesa, yana da matuƙar muhimmanci hanyoyin da za ka riƙa sabuntawa akai-akai, ciki har da hanyoyin plugins, scripts, da resources su kasance suna da damar karantawa/rubutawa domin mai tara bayanan zai buƙaci sabunta waɗannan hanyoyin daga abubuwan da ke cikin babbar uwar garken yanar gizon."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "Ana Buƙatar Izinin Rubutawa a Lokacin Shigarwa Kaɗai"

#: lib/installer.php package_import.php
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Ba a Iya Rubutawa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable after Install Complete"
msgstr "Ana Buƙatar Izinin Rubutawa Bayan Kammala Shigarwa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Potential permission issues"
msgstr "Matsalolin izini da ka iya faruwa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please make sure that your webserver has read/write access to the cacti folders that show errors below."
msgstr "Da fatan za a tabbatar uwar garken yanar gizonka tana da damar karantawa/rubutawa ga foldocin cacti da ke nuna kurakurai a ƙasa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If SELinux is enabled on your server, you can either permanently disable this, or temporarily disable it and then add the appropriate permissions using the SELinux command-line tools."
msgstr "Idan an kunna SELinux a kan uwar garkenka, za ka iya kashe shi har abada, ko kuma ka kashe shi na ɗan lokaci sannan ka ƙara izinin da suka dace ta amfani da kayan aikin layin umarni na SELinux."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "The user '%s' should have MODIFY permission to enable read/write."
msgstr "Ya kamata mai amfani '%s' ya kasance yana da izinin MODIFY don ba da damar karantawa/rubutawa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "An example of how to set folder permissions is shown here, though you may need to adjust this depending on your operating system, user accounts and desired permissions."
msgstr "An nuna misalin yadda ake saita izinin folda a nan, ko da yake za ka iya buƙatar daidaita wannan dangane da tsarin aikinka, asusun masu amfani da kuma izinin da kake so."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "EXAMPLE:"
msgstr "MISALI:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once installation has completed the CSRF path, should be set to read-only."
msgstr "Da zarar an kammala shigarwar, ya kamata a saita hanyar CSRF ta zama ta karantawa kaɗai."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Ana iya rubutawa a duk foldocin"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Kariyar Jerin Izini na Tabbatar da Shigar da Bayanai"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Cacti poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Ana iya amfani da Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai na Cacti waɗanda ke kiran rubutun umarni ta hanyoyin da wanda ba mai gudanarwa ba zai iya yin lahani ga fayilolin da asusun poller ya mallaka, kuma a yanayin da wani ke gudanar da poller na Cacti a matsayin root, zai iya lalata tsarin aikin kwamfutar wanda hakan zai ba wa mahara damar kutse cikin kayayyakin sadarwarku."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Cacti was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Cacti more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Cacti administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Saboda haka, tun a sigogi da dama da suka gabata, an inganta Cacti don samar da damar Jerin Izini (Whitelist) kan waɗannan nau'ikan Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai. Ko da yake wannan yana ƙara wa Cacti tsaro sosai, yana ƙara yawan aikin da ake buƙata daga mai gudanar da Cacti wajen shigo da Samfura da Fakiti da kuma sarrafa su."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Yadda tsarin Jerin Izini (Whitelisting) ke aiki shi ne idan ka fara shigo da Hanyar Shigar da Bayanai, ko kuma ka sake shigo da Hanyar Shigar da Bayanai, kuma rubutun umarnin da/ko bayanansa suka canza ta kowace hanya, za a kashe Hanyar Shigar da Bayanan da duk Tushen Bayanan da suka dace da ita nan take har sai mai gudanarwa ya tabbatar da cewa Hanyar Shigar da Bayanan tana da inganci."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Cacti's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Domin sauƙaƙa gano Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai a wannan yanayin, mun samar da rubutun tantancewa a cikin kundin CLI na Cacti wanda za a iya gudanar da shi tare da zaɓuɓɓuka masu zuwa:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Wannan zaɓin rubutun zai bincika duk wasu Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai da aka haramta a halin yanzu kuma ya bayar da cikakkun bayanai game da dalilin."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Wannan zaɓin rubutun yana cire haramcin Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai da aka haramta a halin yanzu."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Wannan zaɓin rubutun zai sake kunna duk wasu Tushen Bayanai da aka kashe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed."
msgstr "Ana ba da shawara sosai ka sabunta config.php naka don kunna wannan fasalin ta hanyar cire alamar sharhi a kan mai canzawa na <b>$input_whitelist</b> sannan ka gudanar da zaɓuɓɓukan rubutun CLI guda uku da ke sama bayan an kammala shigarwa ta yanar gizo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Yi alama a akwatin zaɓin da ke ƙasa don tabbatar da cewa ka karanta kuma ka fahimci wannan damuwar tsaro"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Na karanta wannan bayani"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Tsarin Asali"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources.  This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Cacti Server host.  Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Da fatan za a zaɓi Bayanin Tushen Bayanai na asali da za a yi amfani da shi wajen binciken tushe. Wannan shi ne matsakaicin adadin lokaci tsakanin binciken na'urori don samun bayanai, don haka yadda tazarar binciken ta yi ƙasa, haka aikin zai ƙaru a kan uwar garken Cacti. Haka kuma, zaɓi tazarar Cron da aka yi niyya ko aka saita da kake son amfani da ita don Tattara Bayanai."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cron Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Cron"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Automation Network"
msgstr "Hanyar Sadarwa ta Sarrafa Kanta ta Asali"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "Cacti na iya bincikar hanyar sadarwa ta atomatik da zarar an kammala shigarwa. Wannan zai yi amfani da zangon hanyar sadarwa da ke ƙasa don gano jerin adiresoshin IP da za a iya bincika. An riga an ayyana jerin zaɓuɓɓuka na bincike waɗanda suka haɗa da amfani da ƙungiyoyin 'public' da 'private'."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Idan na'urorinka suna buƙatar a fara amfani da wani saitin zaɓuɓɓuka daban, za ka iya ayyana su a ƙasa kuma za a yi amfani da su kafin na asali"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All options may be adjusted post installation"
msgstr "Ana iya daidaita dukkan zaɓuɓɓuka bayan shigarwa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Asali"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Scan Mode"
msgstr "Yanayin Bincike"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Network Range"
msgstr "Zangon Hanyar Sadarwa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Defaults"
msgstr "Ƙarin Zaɓuɓɓukan Asali"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional SNMP Options"
msgstr "Ƙarin Zaɓuɓɓukan SNMP"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Error Locating Profiles"
