#: utilities.php
msgid "Poller Cache Administration"
msgstr "Gudanar da Cache na Poller"

#: utilities.php
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne bayanan da ake miƙawa ga poller duk lokacin da ya yi aiki. Ana gudanar da/fassara waɗannan bayanan sannan a shigar da sakamakon cikin fayilolin RRD don zana jadawali ko rumbun adana bayanai don nunawa."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Cache na Tambayar Bayanai yana adana bayanan da aka tattara daga nau'ikan shigarwar Tambayar Bayanai. Ana iya amfani da ƙimomin waɗannan filayen a wurin rubutu na Jadawalai don Bayanin Alamomi (Legends), Lakabin Tsaye, da GPRINTS har ma da cikin CDEF."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Sake Gina Cache na Poller"

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "Za a sake samar da Cache na Poller idan ka zaɓi wannan zaɓin. Yi amfani da wannan zaɓin ne kaɗai idan rumbun adana bayanai ya samu matsala kuma kana fuskantar matsaloli bayan lalacewar kuma ka riga ka gudanar da kayan aikin gyara rumbun adana bayanai. Ko kuma, idan kana samun matsaloli da wata Na'ura ta musamman, kawai ka sake adana wannan Na'urar don sake gina Cache na Poller ɗinta. Akwai kuma kwatankwacin wannan umarnin a layin umarni wanda aka ba da shawarar amfani da shi ga manyan tsare-tsare."

#: utilities.php
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "LURA: A manyan tsare-tsare, wannan umarnin na iya ɗaukar mintuna ko sa'o'i masu yawa kafin ya kammala, don haka bai kamata a gudanar da shi daga mahadar Cacti UI ba. Za ka iya gudanar da 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' a layin umarni don ƙarin bayani."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Sake Gina Cache na Albarkatu"

#: utilities.php
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Lokacin da ake gudanar da Masu Tattara Bayanai da yawa a Cacti, Cacti zai yi ƙoƙarin kiyaye yanayin muhimman fayiloli a kan dukkan Masu Tattara Bayanai. Wannan ya haɗa da dukkan ainihin fayilolin gidan yanar gizo da na ƙari (plugin) waɗanda ba su da alaƙa da shigarwa. Idan ka tilasta sake gina Cache na Albarkatu, Cacti zai share Cache na Albarkatu na gida, sannan ya sake gina shi a farkon lokacin poller na gaba da aka tsara. Wannan zai sa dukkan Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa su sake duba fayilolin gidan yanar gizonsu da na ƙari don daidaito."

